    &gt;Discord&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build &lt;strong&gt;agent-native applications&lt;/strong&gt; — on any framework, on any surface.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Generative UI, shared state, and human-in-the-loop workflows for React, Angular, Vue, React Native — and beyond the browser.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://go.copilotkit.ai/copilotkit-docs&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
