&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to contribute but not sure how? &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://discord.gg/6dffbvGU3D&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Join our Discord&lt;/a&gt; and we&amp;rsquo;ll help you out!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;install-as-a-claude-code-plugin&#34;&gt;Install as a Claude Code plugin
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The CopilotKit monorepo doubles as a Claude Code plugin — all 9 skills (3 package meta-skills + 6 lifecycle journey skills) are available once installed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Add the repo as a Claude Code marketplace:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;claude plugin marketplace add https://github.com/CopilotKit/CopilotKit
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;claude plugin install copilotkit
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Skills are discovered from &lt;code&gt;skills/&amp;lt;slug&amp;gt;/SKILL.md&lt;/code&gt; at the repo root. The three package meta-skills (&lt;code&gt;runtime&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;react-core&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;a2ui-renderer&lt;/code&gt;) are &lt;strong&gt;generated mirrors&lt;/strong&gt; of the source-of-truth files at &lt;code&gt;packages/&amp;lt;pkg&amp;gt;/skills/&amp;lt;pkg&amp;gt;/&lt;/code&gt; — do not edit the mirror directly. To update content, edit the source under &lt;code&gt;packages/*/skills/&lt;/code&gt; and run:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;pnpm sync:plugin-skills
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;A lefthook pre-commit check (&lt;code&gt;pnpm check:plugin-skills&lt;/code&gt;) rejects commits that drift the mirror. The plugin version is pinned to &lt;code&gt;packages/runtime/package.json&lt;/code&gt; and is also kept in sync by the same script.&lt;/p&gt;
